      "Status": "pass",
      "Evidence": "The aerobloc passage seduces before any horror lands: \u0027A city block... held aloft on an eigenlift frame so wide she had to work to find its edges in the murk,\u0027 followed by her palm on the glass and the physical joy of reverse-engineering it \u2014 \u0027Something settled in behind her sternum, warm and level and entirely uninvited\u0027 \u2014 and the terminal\u0027s Hyper Reality noise, the AIs that \u0027talk to her,\u0027 and the lived-in wrongness of jury-rigged ductwork (\u0027Nobody had redrawn any of it since the day it first went in, and she liked it the better for that\u0027) all build allure through texture before the extortion plot\u0027s menace takes over.",
      "Fix": null
    },
    {
