      "Evidence": "Nanites (used implicitly via \u0027suppression fields\u0027/eigenlift, matter-shaping repairs, and body infrastructure), Schism, and gray-zone/CorpoNation power are all richly textured, and AIs-as-agents is strongly present (the scheduler, the Pivot AI, the coordination node all \u0027want\u0027 to be asked right and respond with warmth). But neuretics are shown mainly as the protagonist\u0027s personal tool for hacking/riding the Pulse illusion, never framed as a social/economic divide between haves and have-nots; and the Schism itself is never named or referenced at all \u2014 the eigenlift/suppression-field tech reads as advanced engineering rather than a physics-breaking rift in reality.",
